  message: "Fixed in PR #1479 (c970d55e05). All 8 listed sites reworded to the emitted edge type (renders -> references in view_template/_view_template_core, enqueues -> event_publishes in ruby.py, crdt_publishes -> event_publishes in yjs_crdt.py), line counts kept; plus 5 sites the item did not list (_view_template_core.py:67 'renders-edge', :105, and axis_meta_keys' four 'event_sourcing edge:' MetaKeySpec descriptions, which also published into docs/schema.json and docs/concept-axes.md, both regenerated). Evidence on dev: grep for the retired spellings in the four files returns 0 lines; scripts/check-docstring-drift --registry-refs reports 5 flagged names (was 16), and the 5 are the false positives WI-sipuk's measurement classified (make_file_id, two UsageContext kind=call, websocket_endpoint fold note, my_brand_new_label placeholder)."  # c51b
